    "description": "Freeze a target unit in place, preventing them from moving. On a failed Mgt saving throw (6 + caster Wit), the target is locked in a Stasis field and cannot take any actions, including counterattacks. On a successful saving throw, the target cannot Move, but may still take their standard or bonus action. This effect lasts for 1 turn.&nbsp;<div style=\"\"><br></div><div>&nbsp;Uses: 1 per Arcane rank</div>",
